  "duration_s": 96.012993,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "这藕是好藕啊，就是心眼儿太多了。领导藕虽然心眼多，但也是您的下酒菜啊。来就来带什么礼物，都都不是外领。领导，您都说了，不是外人，我一直都把您当辈辈看，哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理啊。小李，今天让您荣费领导，您说这些您能来，就是我的荣幸，以后还有很多地方向您请教，不是来这么晚只能吃剩菜了吧？领导，饭在哪儿我都能吃，但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，能赶上已经是我的运气了，你酒量挺好的呀。领导，您可抬举我了，我平时真不太能喝，这不今天和您在一起吃饭，高兴啊，这一高兴就多贪了几杯，这喝就是看不起我。领导，我不是看不起您，我是看不起病。哎，你什么意思啊？怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。领导美满美满，代表幸福美满，这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊。小李，最近表现不错啊，我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，我得提前敬你一杯。听这意思，领导是要高升了呀，我得提前敬领导。一杯这鸭子是好鸭子，就是嘴硬，嘴硬，才守得住秘密哈哈哈哈。关注我，每天学点儿高情商，说话技巧，让你的路越走越宽。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00001",
      "start_ms": 250,
      "end_ms": 1530,
      "text": "这藕是好藕啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1830,
      "end_ms": 3810,
      "text": "就是心眼儿太多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3810,
      "end_ms": 5670,
      "text": "领导藕虽然心眼多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00004",
      "start_ms": 5670,
      "end_ms": 10350,
      "text": "但也是您的下酒菜啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10350,
      "end_ms": 11650,
      "text": "来就来带什么礼物，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00006",
      "start_ms": 11650,
      "end_ms": 12730,
      "text": "都都不是外领。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00007",
      "start_ms": 12730,
      "end_ms": 13510,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00008",
      "start_ms": 13510,
      "end_ms": 14170,
      "text": "您都说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00009",
      "start_ms": 14170,
      "end_ms": 15070,
      "text": "不是外人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00010",
      "start_ms": 15070,
      "end_ms": 16850,
      "text": "我一直都把您当辈辈看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00011",
      "start_ms": 16850,
      "end_ms": 20450,
      "text": "哪有晚辈看长辈空手来的道理啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00012",
      "start_ms": 20450,
      "end_ms": 21170,
      "text": "小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00013",
      "start_ms": 21170,
      "end_ms": 22830,
      "text": "今天让您荣费领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00014",
      "start_ms": 22990,
      "end_ms": 24510,
      "text": "您说这些您能来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00015",
      "start_ms": 24530,
      "end_ms": 25290,
      "text": "就是我的荣幸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00016",
      "start_ms": 25470,
      "end_ms": 27350,
      "text": "以后还有很多地方向您请教，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00017",
      "start_ms": 27350,
      "end_ms": 32200,
      "text": "不是来这么晚只能吃剩菜了吧？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00018",
      "start_ms": 32500,
      "end_ms": 32920,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00019",
      "start_ms": 33100,
      "end_ms": 34180,
      "text": "饭在哪儿我都能吃，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00020",
      "start_ms": 34440,
      "end_ms": 36400,
      "text": "但您这桌不是谁想做就能做的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00021",
      "start_ms": 36400,
      "end_ms": 37940,
      "text": "能赶上已经是我的运气了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00022",
      "start_ms": 40100,
      "end_ms": 41540,
      "text": "你酒量挺好的呀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00023",
      "start_ms": 41640,
      "end_ms": 42060,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00024",
      "start_ms": 42060,
      "end_ms": 43100,
      "text": "您可抬举我了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00025",
      "start_ms": 43200,
      "end_ms": 44400,
      "text": "我平时真不太能喝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00026",
      "start_ms": 44560,
      "end_ms": 45940,
      "text": "这不今天和您在一起吃饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00027",
      "start_ms": 45940,
      "end_ms": 46440,
      "text": "高兴啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00028",
      "start_ms": 46440,
      "end_ms": 47860,
      "text": "这一高兴就多贪了几杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00029",
      "start_ms": 50200,
      "end_ms": 52060,
      "text": "这喝就是看不起我。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00030",
      "start_ms": 52760,
      "end_ms": 53200,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00031",
      "start_ms": 53680,
      "end_ms": 54760,
      "text": "我不是看不起您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00032",
      "start_ms": 55140,
      "end_ms": 57905,
      "text": "我是看不起病。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00033",
      "start_ms": 60210,
      "end_ms": 60450,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00034",
      "start_ms": 60610,
      "end_ms": 61490,
      "text": "你什么意思啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00035",
      "start_ms": 61630,
      "end_ms": 63125,
      "text": "怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00036",
      "start_ms": 63380,
      "end_ms": 64360,
      "text": "领导美满美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00037",
      "start_ms": 64460,
      "end_ms": 65600,
      "text": "代表幸福美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00038",
      "start_ms": 65720,
      "end_ms": 68135,
      "text": "这一辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00039",
      "start_ms": 70340,
      "end_ms": 70720,
      "text": "小李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00040",
      "start_ms": 70720,
      "end_ms": 71960,
      "text": "最近表现不错啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00041",
      "start_ms": 72100,
      "end_ms": 74040,
      "text": "我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00042",
      "start_ms": 74060,
      "end_ms": 75220,
      "text": "我得提前敬你一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00043",
      "start_ms": 75240,
      "end_ms": 75940,
      "text": "听这意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00044",
      "start_ms": 76040,
      "end_ms": 77240,
      "text": "领导是要高升了呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00045",
      "start_ms": 77240,
      "end_ms": 78200,
      "text": "我得提前敬领导。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00046",
      "start_ms": 78200,
      "end_ms": 82015,
      "text": "一杯这鸭子是好鸭子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00047",
      "start_ms": 82460,
      "end_ms": 83275,
      "text": "就是嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00048",
      "start_ms": 84160,
      "end_ms": 84680,
      "text": "嘴硬，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00049",
      "start_ms": 84680,
      "end_ms": 88140,
      "text": "才守得住秘密哈哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00050",
      "start_ms": 90560,
      "end_ms": 91145,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00051",
      "start_ms": 91460,
      "end_ms": 92900,
      "text": "每天学点儿高情商，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00052",
      "start_ms": 92940,
      "end_ms": 93685,
      "text": "说话技巧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8e2a21428ff0f46b_s00053",
      "start_ms": 94040,
      "end_ms": 95795,
      "text": "让你的路越走越宽。"
    }
  ],
